od","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":14.66451,"lng":-17.43443},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"dakar_wv_artisan_boulanger_eric_kayser","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["artisanboulangererickayser","dakar"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"It's along the street of Cafe du Rome towards La Corniche (the sea) and away from the centre two blocks up on your right hand side. Serves fresh, warm croissants, pain au chocolate and pain ain au raisins. The coffee is good and the fruit juices freshly squeezed. You will be surrounded by locals in beautiful Islamic outfits, reading the paper and discussing the latest news.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Dakar"},{"id":"dakar_wv_chez_loutcha","areaId":"dakar","name":"Chez Loutcha","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":14.66867,"lng":-17.43511},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"dakar_wv_chez_loutcha","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["chezloutcha","dakar"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Chez Lutcha is a Cape Verdian restaurant that serves huge portions of excellent food. Cape Verdian (Portuguese inspired) dishes, Senegalese food and international cuisine. Cosy courtyard or air-con dining room. Excellent service.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Dakar"},{"id":"dakar_wv_le_jardin_thailandais","areaId":"dakar","name":"Le Jardin Thailandais","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":14.69304,"l